hared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"P9xNwbMStRsHsVc6K5PDpg","review_id":"x4Mzh-xJ10lNArQRllJgmA","date":"2014-06-22T18:39:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9439883828163147,"text_excerpt":"First time eating at this new restaurant, and I will definitely be back. I had the toast with egg and avocado. Sounds plain and simple, but it was anything but that. So good! Thick, buttery toast and the egg is cooked to perfection. I'd also recommend the hangar steak and eggs and the prosciutto and Brie crepe with an egg. Seems like everything on the menu is delicious, though. The place is small, so you're pretty much guaranteed a wait. There's also no alcohol to help you pass the time. But the food is definitely makes it worth it!"},{"business_id":"P9xNwbMStRsHsVc6K5PDpg","review_id":"e5DYFkhCnrz7amiP3EsjNQ","date":"2019-11-10T15:22:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9412723779678345,"text_excerpt":"Wow! What a place to have breakfast. I am not much of a breakfast guy, but when the urge hits me, I like to go to a local breakfast spot and have all the bacon... Me and the lady came here due to us both being off on a Friday. The place is pretty tight, so it would explain why there was a line, but being that we are just two people, we were seated pretty quickly. The food is worth the wait though. French truck coffee already had me, then we had the Monte Cristo french toast sandwich, hanger steak, and those pancake balls that were delicious! Everything that we ordered was made fresh. If you don't mind waiting, go try this place out."},{"business_id":"P9xNwbMStRsHsVc6K5PDpg","review_id":"BkSHuGqwW8iG_UpN45_66g","date":"2015-05-14T13:47:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9391992092132568,"text_excerpt":"I love this place and I've only been here once! Omgoodness. We came on a Sunday morning around 11AM and only waited about 10-15 minutes, which was amazing! It got fairly packed like 10 seconds after we were seated. Once we were seated, she took our order and the food came very quickly. Aebleskivers: they're just round pancake balls. Lol. But, still worth a try. I got the lemon curd and the caramel sauce. I love caramel! The lemon curd was a bit too sour for my taste so I didn't enjoy it as much as the caramel. Cinnamon roll: just a regular cinnamon roll. Soft, sweet, delicious. Steak and eggs: my bf thinks this is the best in the city. I'd disagree, but it is pretty good. The sauce that t..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"P9xNwbMStRsHsVc6K5PDpg","photo_id":"EyYMfhKC-CZYSl2zPXcNHQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/EyYMfhKC-CZYSl2zPXcNHQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9121747016906738},{"business_id":"P9xNwbMStRsHsVc6K5PDpg","photo_id":"JTfI4nEtaXa4d0VsgMk5Tg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JTfI4nEtaXa4d0VsgMk5Tg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8662731051445007},{"business_id":"P9xNwbMStRsHsVc6K5PDpg","photo_id":"hm7bEERF1ptk16KXzf1Mfg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/hm7bEERF1ptk16KXzf1Mfg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.861797034740448},{"business_id":"P9xNwbMStRsHsVc6K5PDpg","photo_id":"VpUA6svjS9cBup_Ck13TAA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VpUA6svjS9cBup_Ck13TAA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8419939875602722},{"business_i